{
  "action": "talk_to_Rita",
  "words": "Rita, morning. I'm not doing the 'let's figure it out together' dance today. Weather at ten, I'm in and out, and I'm on that one o'clock coach no matter what the town band needs. You got me?",
  "intention": "Lock the ten a.m. shoot time and confirm I'm free to hit the depot at one.",
  "detail": "I'm leaning on the windowsill with both forearms, coat still half-on, listening for the answer before I straighten up."
}
